  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Leads Middle East Regional LBN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUMMARY
The She Leads regional Middle East programme support and facilitate GYW-led organisations and feminist activists&#x2019; access to influential decision makers and influencers on regional level. The issues flagged and the initiatives started by GYW-led organisations in She Leads countries will be amplified at relevant regional making spaces and fora. Apart from international advocacy with and by GYW-led organisations, the She Leads consortium members will strengthen the connections between GYW-led organisations at regional level and will amplify their media messages and campaigns towards a broader (cross-country) public, engaging a variety of media, influencers and role models. With She Leads&#x2019; support and advocacy, and stooled on data as evidence base and the partnership of the Dutch Ministry, GYW-led organisations across She Leads Jordan and Lebaon will be able to gain more (sustained) influence and push for policies and processes benefitting their human rigths</narrative>
  </description>
